   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">PACIFIC OCEAN (April 24, 2021) A Vanilla ultra endurance land-launched unmanned aerial vehicle (UAV) operates during U.S. Pacific FleetÃ­s Unmanned Systems Integrated Battle Problem (UxS IBP) 21 at Naval Base Ventura County, Point Mugu. UxS IBP 21 integrates manned and unmanned capabilities into challenging operational scenarios to generate warfighting advantages. (U.S. Navy photo by Construction Mechanic 2nd Class Michael Schutt)</rdf:li>
